title: 'bridges relayer: embedded smoldot light-client transport'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    `substrate-relay` can read chain data from an embedded smoldot light client
    (`--<prefix>-chain-spec`, `--<prefix>-relay-chain-spec`) instead of a full node RPC
    (`--<prefix>-uri`). GRANDPA justifications are taken from warp-sync proofs. Equivocation
    detection still requires `--<prefix>-uri`.
crates:
- name: relay-substrate-client
  bump: major
- name: substrate-relay-helper
  bump: major
